          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "43953086D8BF99E0",
      "text": "You feeling rested and recovered after our big\\nadventure down in the underdepths?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "43953186D8BF9B93",
      "text": "Oh, youth really is an enviable thing!\\c\\nI’m still feeling all wrung out despite having\\nbeen back for a while now![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "43953686D8BFA412",
      "text": "Really? I thought you’d be all chipper by now.\\nYouth is on your side, after all![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "43953786D8BFA5C5",
      "text": "But on to why I called you here. Since our return,\\nI’ve been writing up everything we discovered on\\r\\nour expedition. Honestly, I’ve hardly slept![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "43953486D8BFA0AC",
      "text": "I obtained Geeta’s permission to turn it all into a\\nbook, but don’t worry—I’ve made sure to skip a\\r\\nfew details and omit the names of those involved.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "43953586D8BFA25F",
      "text": "So voilà! A proof copy of the book, freshly\\ndelivered from my publisher, just for you.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "43953A86D8BFAADE",
      "text": "I behaved recklessly in the underdepths. I don’t\\nknow what we would’ve done if it weren’t for you.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "43953B86D8BFAC91",
      "text": "You truly deserve a copy of this book—I just\\nhope it’s sufficient as an apology.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "4398B886D8C2B6CF",
      "text": "Ah! But there was something else I needed to\\ncheck with you...\\c\\nWould you mind showing me your Tera Orb,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_11",
      "hash64": "4398B786D8C2B51C",
      "text": "Hmm, I thought as much. It’s behaving just like\\nKieran’s and Carmine’s orbs...[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_12",
      "hash64": "4398BA86D8C2BA35",
      "text": "I think it might be because your orbs were\\ndirectly exposed to the energy from Terapagos.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_13",
      "hash64": "4398B986D8C2B882",
      "text": "Kieran and Carmine say that ever since the\\nunderdepths, they’ve been able to Terastallize\\r\\ntheir Pokémon without charging their Tera Orbs.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_14",
      "hash64": "4398B486D8C2B003",
      "text": "Actually, there’s one more piece of news I should\\nshare with you related to those deepest depths![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_15",
      "hash64": "4398B386D8C2AE50",
      "text": "You know the Terarium Core that hangs from the\\nceiling of the Terarium?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_16",
      "hash64": "4398B686D8C2B369",
      "text": "Well, until now, I’d been keeping it topped up\\nwith a mixture of Paldean soil and water from\\r\\nthe Crystal Pool in Kitakami.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_17",
      "hash64": "4398B586D8C2B1B6",
      "text": "That’s how we’ve been able to stabilize the\\nTerastal phenomenon on our academy grounds.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_18",
      "hash64": "4398C086D8C2C467",
      "text": "But the other day, I tried adding crystals I’d\\ncollected from the underdepths to that mix—and\\r\\nit caused the properties of the core to change![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_19",
      "hash64": "4398BF86D8C2C2B4",
      "text": "The result? Pokémon shining in rainbow colors\\nhave started appearing all over the Terarium!\\r\\nAnd they have the Stellar Tera Type![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_20",
      "hash64": "438E4686D8B9A094",
      "text": "Thanks to this, my research into the Terastal\\nphenomenon is shining brighter than ever![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_23",
      "hash64": "438E4986D8B9A5AD",
      "text": "Oh, and there was one last thing...\\c\\nA man in a blue suit was looking for you over by\\nthe entrance to the academy.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_21",
      "hash64": "438E4786D8B9A247",
      "text": "That’s all I have to report for now! Thanks for\\nsetting aside some time to chat.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0370_bbteacher_22",
      "hash64": "438E4886D8B9A3FA",
      "text": "I’m off to pay a visit to my publisher, so I’ll leave\\nyou to it.\\c\\nNext time we meet, I’ll ask you for a good long\\nlook at Terapagos. Till then![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
